From: =?UTF-8?q?Martin=20Pape=C5=BE?= <martin.papez@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:32:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: GOW3_FB_COPY feedback-loop snapshots for decal pass
 53ee1598

Killzone's decal box pass (ps 53ee1598) draws into the five G-buffer
targets while sampling them. Reads of other texels than the fragment's
own race with the draw; on RDNA3 that shows as flashing coloured dots
and purple edge dashes. Copy the sampled targets before the draw and
bind the copies. GOW3_FB_COPY=0 turns it off, =all applies it to every
feedback-loop draw, or a list of pixel shader hashes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
